203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Develop Quorum, a decentralized software supply-chain verification system where independent builders reproduce software releases from a pinned source commit and publish signed attestations of the resulting artifact. Consumers should be able to verify these attestations against configurable quorum policies before installing a release. The system must detect disagreements between builders and provide an auditable record of the verification process. A working end-to-end demonstration using a real open-source package is expected.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
