/E (People increasingly hold important assets digitally, including encrypted documents, credentials, cryptocurrency wallets, personal records, and other sensitive information. When an owner dies or becomes permanently unavailable, legitimate heirs may have no reliable way to recover these assets. At the same time, releasing them based on a simple inactivity timer creates a serious risk of premature disclosure.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
