877 0 obj
<<
/Title (Generative AI has made digital content increasingly difficult to authenticate. Images, voices, videos, messages, and documents can be individually convincing while inconsistencies between them reveal a coordinated manipulation. Existing detection approaches often analyze each piece independently and may fail when faced with unfamiliar manipulation techniques.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 875 0 R
/Next 880 0 R
>>
endobj
878 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system should reason across multiple inputs rather than treating each artifact independently. It must identify the evidence behind its decisions, handle incomplete or conflicting information, and demonstrate how well it generalizes to manipulation patterns that were not directly represented during training.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 881 0 R
/Next 876 0 R
>>
endobj
